    "category": "Surg Cardio",
    "q": "Endothelin-1 and nitric oxide in pulmonary hypertension, and which drug blocks endothelin?",
    "a": "Endothelin-1 is a vasoconstrictor and key mediator, increased in both cor pulmonale and left heart failure; bosentan is an endothelin-1 receptor antagonist. Nitric oxide synthase is decreased in pulmonary hypertension (NO dilates).",
